stotle/FiniteFiber/VectorCorner.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/OneSitePauliNormalForm.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FinitePauli.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteStabilizerTrace.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteDensity.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/GNSVector.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/StrongSupport.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteLocalPauli.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/SequentialLocalFunctional.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteRegionFullPauliMultiplication.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/TracialCorner.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteStabilizerStateChain.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FinitePauliGNS.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteStabilizer.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/CountablePauliRepresentation.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/ProjectivePauliLattice.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteFibers.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteRegionPhasedPauliMatrices.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FiniteRegionEmbeddingCoherence.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/FiniteFiber/FullPauliSupportLocality.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/tests/FullPauliMultiplicationAxiomAudit.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/tests/AxiomAudit.lean\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/AUTONOMY_POLICY.md\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/ARISTOTLE_SOURCE_CONTEXT.md\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/AGENTS.md\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/HANDOFF.md\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/.gitignore\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/README.md\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/manuscript/mainNotes.bib\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/manuscript/references.bib\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/manuscript/main.tex\naristotle-finite_fiber-ihep3c3q_aristotle/ARISTOTLE_SUMMARY.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
